#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "68_Saejima"
msgid "Hey, nobody said nothing 'bout a uniform."
msgstr "¿Es necesario el traje?..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Tadokoro"
msgid "But it really suits you. Clothes like these look\\r\nespecially good on a man with your physique."
msgstr "No le queda nada mal, Suzuki-san. De hecho, hace resaltar\nmás su gran físico."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Saejima"
msgid "I dunno. Can't shake the feeling that you're messin'\\r\nwith me again."
msgstr "Si tú lo dices... Es solo que me cuesta creer que esto no\nse trata alguna clase de broma."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104_Tadokoro"
msgid "Not at all. I'm being quite honest. Why, in another time,\\r\nanother place, you could pass for a yakuza clan chairman."
msgstr "Estoy siendo sincero, confíe. Fácilmente podrían confundirlo\ncon un cabecilla de la yakuza."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=5
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P5
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "116_Saejima"
msgid "Listen, you..."
msgstr "Oye, un momento..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_Tadokoro"
msgid "Well, I have other work requiring my attention,\\r\nso if you'll excuse me... Good luck, Suzuki-san."
msgstr "Bueno, tengo otro asunto que atender, así que me retiro.\\r\nSuzuki-san, le dejo todo en sus manos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=8
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P8
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "152_Saejima"
msgid "Gotta watch out for that guy..."
msgstr "No confío nada en ese sujeto..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=9
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P9
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "164_Saejima"
msgid "Hey, so what exactly do you want me to do? Haven't worked in a place like this before. Throw me a bone here."
msgstr "Y bien, ¿cómo empiezo? Es la primera vez que trabajo en un\ncasino."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=10
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P10
#. y4:msg_speaker=Casino Manager
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=6
msgctxt "176_Casino Manager"
msgid "Let's see. Can I have you deal at the roulette table?"
msgstr "Veamos... ¿Podría encargarse de la mesa de la ruleta\ncomo crupier?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=11
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P11
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "188_Saejima"
msgid "A roulette dealer? That's way beyond me."
msgstr "¿Un crupier de ruleta? No tengo ni la menor idea de cómo\ndesenvolverme en eso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "200_Casino Manager"
msgid "You'll be fine. All you need to do is stay in one spot\\r\nand act like you know what you're doing."
msgstr "No se complique. Solo deberá quedarse parado en un lugar\ny pretender que sabe lo que está haciendo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Casino Manager
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=6
msgctxt "212_Casino Manager"
msgid "The young woman there will run the actual game."
msgstr "La joven de ahí se encargará de dirigir el juego."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=14
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P14
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "224_Saejima"
msgid "So I stand there... and what?"
msgstr "Entonces, me quedo ahí... ¿Y luego qué?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Casino Manager"
msgid "Well, do you see that fellow over yonder? He's been\\r\ncoming a lot lately, but he's always making a scene."
msgstr "¿Ve a ese sujeto de allá? Aquel es un cliente frecuente.\nPero es uno muy problemático."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_Casino Manager"
msgid "Typically he'll claim he was cheated and won't pay\\r\non his losses, or he'll stumble in drunk and start\\r\na brawl. Some of my employees have gotten hurt."
msgstr "Lo usual es que, cuando pierde, nos acusa de haber hecho\ntrampa y se niega a pagar sus pérdidas. Incluso ha habido\nocasiones en que ha golpeado al personal estando borracho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=17
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P17
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "260_Saejima"
msgid "Gotcha. Ya want me to keep an eye on this joker."
msgstr "Entiendo. Entonces, me aseguraré de estar atento a ese tipo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=18
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P18
#. y4:msg_speaker=Casino Manager
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=6
msgctxt "272_Casino Manager"
msgid "Yes, please and thank you."
msgstr "Gracias, cuento con usted."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=22
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P22
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "320_Saejima"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "332_Roulette Dealer"
msgid "The ball is in play, gentlemen. Place your bets.\\r\nOne minute until betting ends."
msgstr "Se lanzó la bola. Pueden hacer sus apuestas.\nTienen un minuto hasta que termine la ronda."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=24
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P24
#. y4:msg_speaker=Difficult Patron
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=13
msgctxt "344_Difficult Patron"
msgid "Black 20. Black is coming up next. Black for sure!"
msgstr "... El 20 negro. Va a caer en el negro, ¡estoy segurísimo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=25
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P25
#. y4:msg_speaker=Rookie Gambler
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=14
msgctxt "356_Rookie Gambler"
msgid "I think I'll just bet on red."
msgstr "Yo me voy... por el rojo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=26
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P26
#. y4:msg_speaker=Roulette Dealer
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=11
msgctxt "368_Roulette Dealer"
msgid "All set? No more bets, gentlemen."
msgstr "¿Todo listo? Ya no hay más apuestas, caballeros."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=29
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P29
#. y4:msg_speaker=Roulette Dealer
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=11
msgctxt "404_Roulette Dealer"
msgid "Red 14!"
msgstr "¡El 14 rojo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "416_Rookie Gambler"
msgid "Oh wow, I doubled my bet! This must be what they\\r\ncall beginner's luck!"
msgstr "¡Guau, dupliqué mi apuesta! ¡Parece que sí era verdad eso\nde la suerte de principiante!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=31
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P31
#. y4:msg_speaker=Difficult Patron
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=13
msgctxt "428_Difficult Patron"
msgid "Seriously? There's some kind of bullshit going on here!"
msgstr "¡Carajo! ¡Aquí debe estar pasando algo muy raro!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "440_Roulette Dealer"
msgid "Sir... in roulette, bets are placed only after the ball\\r\nis in play. Cheating simply isn't possible."
msgstr "Señor, en este juego, las apuestas se hacen después de que\nla bola haya sido lanzada. Es imposible hacer trampa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "452_Difficult Patron"
msgid "You must be using a magnet or something to move the ball!\\r\nOtherwise, how could I lose this much, huh?"
msgstr "¿Ah, sí? ¡Pues yo creo que deben haber usado algún tipo de\nimán para mover la bola! ¡No tiene sentido que esté teniendo\ntan mala racha!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "464_Complaining Accomplice"
msgid "Yeah, that's right! I saw you fiddling with something\\r\nunder the table just as the ball stopped!"
msgstr "¡Sí, debió ser eso! ¡Vi que hiciste algo debajo de la mesa\nantes de que parara la bola!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "476_Saejima"
msgid "Sir, if you're dissatisfied for some reason,\\r\nhow about you take it up with me?"
msgstr "Señor, si tiene alguna inconformidad, ¿por qué no lo\narreglamos entre usted y yo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=36
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P36
#. y4:msg_speaker=Difficult Patron
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=13
msgctxt "488_Difficult Patron"
msgid "What the... Who do you think you are!?"
msgstr "¿Qué rayos?... ¡¿Quién te crees que eres?!"
